# Local SMTP configuration. Real hosts, usernames and passwords must never
# reach git: the real values belong in environment variables, which is what
# Helpers/SmtpResetNotifier reads first. These rules are the backstop for a
# developer who copies TechStackLearningHub.Web/Smtp.config.template to a
# working file and then forgets to delete it. Smtp.config.template itself is
# documentation and IS tracked, so only real, filled-in files are listed here.
Smtp.config
Smtp.config.local
*.local.config